| **G2.5** | AT5 | AND | `-` |
| **G3** | G3.1, G3.2, G3.3, G3.4, G3.5, G3.6 | AND | `;` |
| **G3.1** | AT6 | AND | `-` |
| **G3.2** | AT7 | AND | `-` |
| **G3.3** | AT8 | AND | `-` |
| **G3.4** | AT9 | AND | `-` |
